ymbol" aria-hidden="true">◈</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Art</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Music &#38; sound：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">♫</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Music &amp; sound</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Voice：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◉</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Voice</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Writing：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✎</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Writing</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Translation：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">文</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Translation</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Marketing：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Marketing</span> </span> </div> <div class="ai-overview-foot"><span><i class="ai-key used"></i>Reported use</span><span><i class="ai-key"></i>Unmarked does not mean AI-free</span><span class="ai-overview-arrow">View evidence ↗</span></div> </a> <div class="ai-chips"> <span class="chip used">Marketing</span>  </div> <div class="actions"> <a class="btn primary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4773930/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam store ↗</a> <button class="btn" id="saveBtn" type="button" title="Saved in this browser only">☆ Save</button> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn" type="button">Share</button> </div> <dl class="facts"> <div><dt>Steam App ID</dt><dd><code>4773930</code><button class="copy" id="copyId" type="button">Copy</button></dd></div> <div><dt>Developer</dt><dd>君临传奇之风起云涌</dd></div> <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>君临传奇之风起云涌</dd></div> <div><dt>Release date</dt><dd>Oct 22, 2026</dd></div> <div><dt>Price</dt><dd>免费开玩</dd></div> <div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Windows</dd></div> <div><dt>Genres</dt><dd>Action / Casual / Indie / Massively Multiplayer / RPG / Free To Play</dd></div> <div><dt>Tags</dt><dd>多人、大型多人在线、应用内购买、家庭共享</dd></div>   <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd class="clamp">简体中文 * , 繁体中文 * * 具有完全音频支持的语言</dd></div>   </dl> </aside> </section> <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page"> <a href="#ai">AI use</a> <a href="#evidence">Evidence</a> <a href="#steam">Steam data</a> <a href="#developer">Developer</a> <a href="#sources">Sources &amp; corrections</a> </nav> <section class="section" id="ai"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">AI USE</div><h2>Eight areas, separate answers</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">1 / 8 areas with reported AI use</div> </div> <div class="status-note tone-amber"> <strong>Official AI disclosure</strong><span>The developer has disclosed generative AI use. The original source defines its scope.</span> </div> <p class="section-lede">A free-to-play retro Legend-style nation-war MMO released on Oct 22, 2026, whose Steam store page lists the same name in the developer and publisher fields rather than a separate studio, filed under Action, Casual, Indie, Massively Multiplayer, RPG and Free To Play. The Steam AI disclosure is one sentence: the developer uses AI to assist in the creation of promotional materials. This site records marketing as used on that wording and the other seven areas as areas the disclosure does not address. Which promotional assets are covered and in what share is not stated, so every finding rests on the developer own statement and none of it has been independently audited.</p>  <div class="table-wrap"> <table class="ai-table"> <thead> <tr><th>Area</th><th>Scope</th><th>Status</th><th>Notes</th></tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>In-game generation</strong><small>In-game AI</small></td> <td class="muted">Content generated during play</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Code</strong><small>Code</small></td> <td class="muted">Programming and development</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Art</strong><small>Art</small></td> <td class="muted">Visual assets</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Music &amp; sound</strong><small>Music &amp; SFX</small></td> <td class="muted">Music and sound</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Voice</strong><small>Voice</small></td> <td class="muted">Voice and dialogue audio</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Writing</strong><small>Writing</small></td> <td class="muted">Story and written content</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Translation</strong><small>Translation</small></td> <td class="muted">Translation and localization</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Marketing</strong><small>Marketing</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Promotional material</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The single disclosure sentence states AI assists in the creation of promotional materials, without naming which assets or what share of them.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="legend"> <span><i class="dot used"></i>Reported use (official / third-party)</span> <span><i class="dot not_stated"></i>Not stated (not proof of no use)</span> <span><i class="dot claimed_none"></i>Developer claims no AI</span> <span><i class="dot unreviewed"></i>Unreviewed</span> </div> <blockquote class="quote"> <p>“We use AI to assist in the creation of promotional materials.”</p> <footer>Steam 商店 AI 生成内容披露栏完整原文，2026-11-04 核查；可能随商店页更新。 · <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4773930/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original ↗</a></footer> </blockquote> <details class="callout"> <summary><strong>How to interpret these statuses</strong></summary> <p>Reported AI use: 1/8. Developer no-use claims: 0/8. Claims are not independent verification; not stated does not mean no AI use.</p> </details> <p class="source-line"> Primary source:<a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4773930/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official disclosure ↗</a> <span> · Reviewed 2026-11-04</span> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="evidence"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE</div><h2>Evidence</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">3 sources</div> </div> <div class="timeline"> <article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Third-party source</span> <time>2026-11-05</time> </div> <h3>AI Transparency Index 对本作商店披露的第三方转录</h3> <p>AI-assisted material appears only on the store page or in marketing AI is used to assist in the creation of promotional materials. Process AI-assisted Live AI during play No Evidence &amp; analysis details Evidence used “use AI to assist in the creation of promotional materials” “We use AI to assist in the creation of promotional materials” Model-reported confidence 95% A model estimate, not a measured accuracy rate or a human review score. Auto-classified from the public disclosure. The raw disclosure below remains the source of truth.</p> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/4773930" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Official disclosure</span> <time>2026-11-04</time> </div> <h3>Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</h3> <p>We use AI to assist in the creation of promotional materials.</p> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4773930/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Steam discussion index</span> <time>2026-11-04</time> </div> <h3>Steam 讨论区首页核查</h3> <p>英文讨论区首页显示 3 个主题（总数 3）；仅覆盖首页。</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/4773930/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article> </div> <details class="callout"><summary><strong>Review notes (expand)</strong></summary><p>Checked the complete English Steam AI disclosure, the identity (the appdetails record and the store page both carry the game title in the developer and publisher fields) and the English discussion homepage (3 visible topics of 3, so the homepage covers every topic); no topic matches the AI keyword search and the three threads are player complaints about operations and drop rates, so no thread needed reading. This title was searched once with Chinese keywords, that one response holds 6 results and 1 raw source was read: the AI Transparency Index entry transcribes the store disclosure verbatim and adds its own automatic classification, process AI-assisted, live AI during play No, with a model-reported confidence of 95 percent, while the same page states that this is auto-classified model output, not an accuracy rate or a human review score, and that the raw disclosure remains the source of truth; this site therefore does not adopt its live-generation finding and keeps that area unaddressed. The other 5 results were the official update announcement behind an italian language parameter (a developer channel rather than third-party coverage), the community homepage, a SteamDB screenshots page and a 17173 product page (both return HTTP 403 to public fetching, so their text could not be read) and a client-rendered price aggregation page whose static body holds 338 characters without the disclosure text; none is registered as a source.</p></details> </section> <section class="section" id="steam"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">STEAM DATA</div><h2>Steam data</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Public data snapshot</div> </div> <div class="stat-grid"> <div class="stat"> <span>Online now</span> <strong>251</strong> <small>Steam public API</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Steam reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>No data</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Positive reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>All languages</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Release date</span> <strong>2026</strong> <small>Oct 22, 2026</small> </div> </div> <div class="steam-desc"><h3>Steam description</h3><p>江湖将乱，风云已动！经典复古高爆国战版传奇，专为兄弟情义与热血厮杀而生！不氪金照样封神，不将就才能称王。极品装备、绝世武学全凭实力爆出，BOSS越狠，爆得越疯，捡到你手软！ 战鼓擂响，屠龙在手，兄弟们整装待发——攻沙、夺城、君临天下！</p></div> <p class="source-line"> Player and review figures are Steam snapshots taken at build time and may be delayed. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4773930/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View current data on Steam ↗</a> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="developer"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER</div><h2>Developer</h2></div></div> <div class="dev-card"> <div class="dev-avatar">君临</div> <div class="dev-body"> <h3>君临传奇之风起云涌</h3> <p>Developer / publisher</p> <div class="dev-links">  <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/search/?developer=%E5%90%9B%E4%B8%B4%E4%BC%A0%E5%A5%87%E4%B9%8B%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer on Steam ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=%E5%90%9B%E4%B8%B4%E4%BC%A0%E5%A5%87%E4%B9%8B%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C%EF%BC%884773930%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F4773930-game%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claim / correct ↗</a> </div> </div> </div>  </section> <section class="section" id="community"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</div><h2>Player impressions</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Separate from official disclosures</div> </div> <p class="section-lede">Player impressions are not evidence of AI use. Votes do not change developer disclosure findings.</p> <form id="voteForm" class="vote-form"> <select id="voteSelect" required aria-label="Choose your impression"> <option value="">Your impression…</option> <option value="no_ai_suspected">I suspect no AI use</option> <option value="some_ai_suspected">I suspect some AI use</option> <option value="heavy_ai_suspected">I suspect extensive AI use</option> <option value="all_ai_suspected">I suspect AI throughout</option> </select> <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Submit</button> </form> <p id="voteMessage" class="muted" role="status"></p> <div id="voteCounts" class="vote-counts"></div> <p class="source-line">Feedback availability does not affect the evidence. One vote per network per game.</p> </section> <section class="section" id="sources"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOURCES</div><h2>Sources &amp; review limits</h2></div></div> <ul class="source-list"> <li> <span>Third-party source</span> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/4773930" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI Transparency Index 对本作商店披露的第三方转录</a> <time>2026-11-05</time> </li><li> <span>Official disclosure</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4773930/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</a> <time>2026-11-04</time> </li><li> <span>Steam discussion index</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/4773930/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 讨论区首页核查</a> <time>2026-11-04</time> </li> <li> <span>Steam store</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4773930/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">君临传奇之风起云涌 · App 4773930</a> <time></time> </li> </ul> <div class="callout"> <strong>Found an error?</strong> <p> Please include an original source, date and specific correction. <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=%E5%90%9B%E4%B8%B4%E4%BC%A0%E5%A5%87%E4%B9%8B%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C%EF%BC%884773930%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F4773930-game%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a correction ↗</a> or <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=%E5%90%9B%E4%B8%B4%E4%BC%A0%E5%A5%87%E4%B9%8B%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C%20%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue ↗</a>。
</p> </div> </section> <div class="share-bar"> <span>Share this game</span> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn2" type="button">Copy link</button> <a class="btn" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Does%20%E5%90%9B%E4%B8%B4%E4%BC%A0%E5%A5%87%E4%B9%8B%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C%20use%20AI%3F&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F4773930-game%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Share on X</a> <a class="btn" href="https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F4773930-game%2F&title=%E5%90%9B%E4%B8%B4%E4%BC%A0%E5%A5%87%E4%B9%8B%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E4%BA%91%E6%B6%8C%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20use%20evidence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reddit</a> </div> </main> <div class="tf-cta-wrap"><a class="tf-cta" href="https://toolfavor.com/?utm_source=gameaichecker&utm_medium=footer_button" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9.5l-4.6 1.9L12 16l-1.9-4.6L5.5 9.5l4.6-1.9z"></path><path d="M19 15l.8 1.9 1.9.8-1.9.8L19 20.4l-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.8z"></path></svg><span>Discover more useful tools on ToolFavor</span><svg class="tf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="wrap"> <span>Game AI Checker · Independent of Valve / Steam.</span> <span>Evidence first · Not stated does not mean unused</span> </div> </footer> <dialog class="lightbox" id="lightbox"> <button id="closeLightbox" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button> <img id="lightboxImg" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"> <div class="lightbox-caption" id="lightboxCaption"></div> </dialog> <script>
    (() => {
      const app = document.getElementById('app');
      const labels = JSON.parse(app?.dataset.ui || '{}');
      const tx = key => labels[key] || key;
      const en = document.documentElement.lang === 'en';
      const key = app?.dataset.gameKey || '';
      const slug = app?.dataset.slug || '';

      document.querySelectorAll('img[data-fallback]').forEach((img) => {
        const fallback = img.dataset.fallback;
        if (!fallback) return;
        img.addEventListener('error', function onError() {
          img.removeEventListener('error', onError);
          img.dataset.fallback = '';
          img.src = fallback;
          img.addEventListener('error', () => { img.style.display = 'none'; }, { once: true });
        });
      });

      const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');
      const heroMedia = document.getElementById('heroMedia');
      const thumbs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.thumb'));
      const counter = document.getElementById('mediaCount');
      const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pauseBtn');
      let index = 0;
      let paused = false;
      let hovering = false;
      let timer = null;

      const warmedImages = new Set();
      function warm(full) {
        if (!full || warmedImages.has(full)) return null;
        warmedImages.add(full);
        const image = new Image();
        image.decoding = 'async';
        image.src = full;
        return image;
      }
      // Browse one frame ahead so the lightbox never waits on a cold round trip.
      function warmAround() {
        if (!thumbs.length) return;
        const upcoming = [thumbs[index], thumbs[(index + 1) % thumbs.length]];
        const run = () => upcoming.forEach((thumb) => thumb && warm(thumb.dataset.full));
        if (typeof window.requestIdleCallback === 'function') window.requestIdleCallback(run, { timeout: 1500 });
        else setTimeout(run, 500);
      }

      function show(next) {
        if (!heroImg || !thumbs.length) return;
        index = (next + thumbs.length) % thumbs.length;
        const thumb = thumbs[index];
        heroImg.src = thumb.dataset.src || heroImg.src;
        heroImg.dataset.full = thumb.dataset.full || heroImg.dataset.full;
        thumbs.forEach((item, position) => item.classList.toggle('active', position === index));
        if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
        warmAround();
      }

      function schedule() {
        clearInterval(timer);
        if (thumbs.length < 2 || paused || hovering || document.hidden) return;
        timer = setInterval(() => show(index + 1), 6000);
      }

      thumbs.forEach((thumb) => {
        thumb.addEventListener('click', () => {
          show(Number(thumb.dataset.index || 0));
          schedule();
        });
      });

      document.getElementById('prevBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index - 1); schedule(); });
      document.getElementById('nextBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index + 1); schedule(); });
      pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        paused = !paused;
        pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : 'Ⅱ';
        pauseBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', paused ? tx("继续轮播") : tx("暂停轮播"));
        schedule();
      });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { hovering = true; schedule(); });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', schedule);
      schedule();

      const appId = app?.dataset.appid;
      if (appId && heroImg && !heroImg.getAttribute('src')?.startsWith('/images/steam/')) {
        fetch(`/api/steam-media?id=${encodeURIComponent(appId)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            if (!data?.available) return;
            for (const shot of data.screenshots || []) {
              const src = shot.thumbnail || shot.full;
              const full = shot.full || shot.thumbnail;
              if (!src || thumbs.some((thumb) => thumb.dataset.full === full)) continue;
              const thumb = document.createElement('button');
              thumb.className = 'thumb';
              thumb.type = 'button';
              thumb.dataset.src = src;
              thumb.dataset.full = full;
              thumb.dataset.index = String(thumbs.length);
              thumb.setAttribute('aria-label', `第 ${thumbs.length + 1} 张图片`);
              const image = document.createElement('img');
              image.src = src;
              image.alt = '';
              image.loading = 'lazy';
              image.decoding = 'async';
              thumb.append(image);
              thumb.addEventListener('click', () => { show(Number(thumb.dataset.index)); schedule(); });
              document.getElementById('thumbs')?.append(thumb);
              thumbs.push(thumb);
            }
            if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
            const countText = document.getElementById('mediaCountText');
            if (countText) countText.textContent = `${thumbs.length} ${en ? 'official images' : '张官方图片'}`;
            schedule();

            if (data.movies?.length) {
              const mediaCol = document.querySelector('.media-col');
              let videos = document.querySelector('.videos');
              if (!videos && mediaCol) {
                videos = document.createElement('div');
                videos.className = 'videos';
                videos.innerHTML = '<div class="mini-title"></div><div class="video-grid"></div>';
                videos.querySelector('.mini-title').textContent = tx('宣传视频');
                mediaCol.append(videos);
              }
              const grid = videos?.querySelector('.video-grid');
              if (grid) {
                const first = data.movies.find((movie) => movie.webm || movie.mp4);
                if (first) {
                  const player = document.createElement('video');
                  player.className = 'trailer';
                  player.controls = true;
                  player.preload = 'none';
                  player.poster = first.thumbnail || '';
                  player.src = first.webm || first.mp4;
                  grid.before(player);
                }
                for (const movie of data.movies.slice(0, 4)) {
                  if (!movie.thumbnail) continue;
                  const link = document.createElement('a');
                  link.className = 'video-card';
                  link.href = data.steamUrl || `https://store.steampowered.com/app/${appId}/`;
                  link.target = '_blank';
                  link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
                  const poster = document.createElement('img');
                  poster.src = movie.thumbnail;
                  poster.alt = movie.name || tx("宣传视频");
                  poster.loading = 'lazy';
                  const label = document.createElement('span');
                  label.textContent = `${movie.name || tx("观看宣传视频")} ↗`;
                  link.append(poster, label);
                  grid.append(link);
                }
              }
            }
          })
          .catch(() => {});
      }

      const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
      const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
      const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightboxCaption');
      function openLightbox() {
        if (!heroImg || !lightbox || !lightboxImg) return;
        const full = heroImg.dataset.full || heroImg.src;
        // The 1280 hero frame is already decoded, so the dialog shows at once and upgrades in place.
        lightboxImg.src = heroImg.currentSrc || heroImg.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (lightboxCaption) lightboxCaption.textContent = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (typeof lightbox.showModal === 'function') lightbox.showModal();
        const larger = warm(full);
        if (larger) larger.onload = () => { lightboxImg.src = larger.src; };
      }
      document.getElementById('openLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      heroImg?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      [document.getElementById('openLightbox'), heroMedia].forEach((node) => node?.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => warm(heroImg?.dataset.full), { once: true }));
      document.getElementById('closeLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', () => lightbox?.close());
      lightbox?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { if (event.target === lightbox) lightbox.close(); });

      const saveBtn = document.getElementById('saveBtn');
      const starKey = `gac:star:${slug}`;
      function paintStar() {
        if (!saveBtn) return;
        const active = localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1';
        saveBtn.textContent = active ? tx("★ 已收藏") : tx("☆ 收藏");
        saveBtn.classList.toggle('active', active);
      }
      saveBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1') localStorage.removeItem(starKey);
        else localStorage.setItem(starKey, '1');
        paintStar();
      });
      paintStar();

      async function copyLink() {
        const url = window.location.href;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
          flash(tx("链接已复制"));
        } catch {
          window.prompt(tx("复制链接"), url);
        }
      }
      function flash(message) {
        const target = document.getElementById('voteMessage') || document.getElementById('shareBtn');
        if (!target) return;
        const original = target.textContent;
        if (target.id === 'voteMessage') {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = original; }, 2200);
        } else {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = tx("分享"); }, 2200);
        }
      }
      async function share() {
        if (navigator.share) {
          try {
            await navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: window.location.href });
            return;
          } catch {}
        }
        copyLink();
      }
      document.getElementById('shareBtn')?.addEventListener('click', share);
      document.getElementById('shareBtn2')?.addEventListener('click', copyLink);

      document.getElementById('copyId')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const id = app?.dataset.appid;
        if (!id) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(id);
          flash(tx("App ID 已复制"));
        } catch {}
      });

      const voteForm = document.getElementById('voteForm');
      const voteMessage = document.getElementById('voteMessage');
      const voteCounts = document.getElementById('voteCounts');
      const voteSelect = document.getElementById('voteSelect');
      const voteNames = {
        no_ai_suspected: tx("认为没有使用 AI"),
        some_ai_suspected: tx("认为部分使用 AI"),
        heavy_ai_suspected: tx("认为大量使用 AI"),
        all_ai_suspected: tx("认为几乎全程使用 AI"),
      };
      function showCounts(counts) {
        if (!voteCounts) return;
        voteCounts.replaceChildren();
        for (const [code, label] of Object.entries(voteNames)) {
          const value = Number(counts?.[code] || 0);
          if (!value) continue;
          const row = document.createElement('div');
          row.textContent = en ? `${value} players ${label}` : `${value} 位玩家${label}`;
          voteCounts.append(row);
        }
      }
      if (voteForm && key) {
        fetch(`/api/feedback?game=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            showCounts(data.counts);
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈功能已启用。");
          })
          .catch(() => {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("匿名反馈暂未启用，等待管理员配置数据库。");
          });
        voteForm.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          const vote = voteSelect?.value;
          if (!vote) return;
          const button = voteForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
          if (button) button.disabled = true;
          try {
            const response = await fetch('/api/feedback', {
              method: 'POST',
              headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ game: key, vote }),
            });
            const data = await response.json();
            if (!response.ok) {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = response.status === 409 ? tx("该网络已对本游戏投过票。") : tx("提交失败，请稍后再试。");
              if (data.counts) showCounts(data.counts);
            } else {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈已记录，谢谢参与。");
              showCounts(data.counts);
              voteForm.reset();
            }
          } catch {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("网络错误，请稍后重试。");
          } finally {
            if (button) button.disabled = false;
          }
        });
      }

      const navLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a'));
      if (navLinks.length && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        const linksById = new Map(navLinks.map((link) => [link.getAttribute('href')?.slice(1), link]));
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          for (const entry of entries) {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
            navLinks.forEach((link) => link.classList.remove('active'));
            linksById.get(entry.target.id)?.classList.add('active');
          }
        }, { rootMargin: '-35% 0px -55% 0px' });
        document.querySelectorAll('section[id]').forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
      }
    })();
  </script> <script>
    document.getElementById('game-language')?.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
      const slug = document.getElementById('app')?.dataset.slug;
      if (slug) window.location.assign('/games/' + (event.target.value === 'en' ? '' : event.target.value + '/') + encodeURIComponent(slug) + '/' + location.hash);
    });
  </script> </body> </html>